The '''Challenge System''' is a system intended to suggest skill training methods to players. Daily Challenges can be accessed using the third tab in the [[Interface#Adventures|Adventures]] interface, labelled "Challenges". 

==Basic challenges==
Before players gain access to the [[#Daily challenges|daily challenges]], they must complete a set of seven basic challenges. These challenges are an introduction to the daily challenges system and grant no [[experience]] rewards. All can be completed in [[Burthorpe]].

These can be skipped by speaking to the [[Challenge Mistress Fara]] in [[Burthorpe]]. Skipping these will not grant experience.

Unlike daily challenges, basic challenges will auto-repopulate the Challenge systems tab until all seven are completed. At that point, basic challenges will no longer be available and daily challenges will appear.

