===Rewards===
The only reward for completing a Returner Challenge is progress towards a set of progress rewards, which work much like the weekly rewards available from daily challenges. Like weekly rewards, there are seven tiers of rewards available, each being unlocked by completing three challenges. Unlike weekly rewards, this reward track is not replaced each week, but remains until all seven rewards have been claimed or 20 days have passed.

