==Development history==
The Challenge System was [[Update:Daily Challenges & Noticeboard|released]] on [[19 September]] [[2012]] and first [[Update:Game Update: Christmas 2019 & Daily Challenge Rework|reworked]] on [[16 December]] [[2019]], subsequently being reworked again on [[15 November]] [[2021]], adding a [[Challenge System#Weekly Progress|Weekly Reward Track]].

On [[4 September]] [[2023]], [[Update:Hero Pass: Underworld - This Week in RuneScape|Hero Pass update]], the challenge system was replaced with [[Hero Pass]]. The removal of challenges was [[Update:Ancient Awakening Launches - This Week in RuneScape|reversed]] a month later on [[9 October]] [[2023]].

Until an [[Update:Patch Notes (17 October 2016)|update]], players could receive a "Lucky Challenge".

