===Weekly progress===
Before the [[DailyScape Overhaul]] on [[16 March]] [[2026]], claiming rewards from a completed daily challenge earned progression for the Weekly Progress bar, which reset on Wednesday at 00:00 in game time. There were seven tiers of Weekly Reward Chests to unlock each week. It took three challenges for each unlock, but challenges extended with [[vis wax]] counted as double. The Weekly Rewards interface could be opened at any time by clicking on one of the Weekly Reward Chests in the challenges interface. From the Weekly Rewards interface all of the unlocked rewards could be collected at once.

RuneScape members received the rewards from both the member and free-to-play reward pools, while non-members got only the free-to-play rewards. [[Ironman mode|Ironman players]] had the restricted rewards replaced with [[coins]].

The members' rewards cycled through the following eight sets of weekly rewards in order, before starting over. Breaking your Daily Challenge streak did not affect the order of the rewards.

