===Rerolls and extensions===
Until the [[DailyScape Overhaul]] on [[16 March]] [[2026]], members could reroll or extend daily challenges from the Challenges tab using [[vis wax]]. A reroll cost 10 wax (worth {{NoCoins|{{GEP|vis wax|10}}|c}}) and an extension cost 25 (worth {{NoCoins|{{GEP|vis wax|25}}|c}}). 

An extended challenge would be doubled in length, and the player would receive double the experience reward and Weekly Progress. A challenge could be extended after progressing on it or even after completing it as long as it had not been handed in. Two [[challenge token]]s were required to complete an extended daily challenge.

When a challenge was rerolled, the player would be given a choice between the original challenge and a random new one. The original challenge could be kept, but the vis wax would not be refunded. Challenges could be rerolled as many times as you like.

If an extended challenge was rerolled, the new challenge would not be extended. If the original challenge was kept it would still be extended. The random new challenge could be extended, as extending the original challenge did not count if the new challenge is chosen. If the new challenge was chosen, the vis wax for extending the original challenge would not be refunded.

